---
/*
  Manifold's 30-second product teaser (plan P5.T2): real product footage, re-encoded to 720p
  H.264 with no audio track (~0.5 MB), shown with a poster. Never autoplays and has no sound
  (veto); nothing downloads until the reader presses play (preload="none").
  The teaser's on-screen scores are the model's confidence on one demo photo, not an accuracy
  figure, and the caption says so: the site's measured numbers live in the metrics registry.
*/
---

<figure class="product-video">
  <video
    src="/media/manifold-teaser.mp4"
    poster="/media/manifold-teaser-poster.webp"
    width="1280"
    height="720"
    controls
    muted
    playsinline
    preload="none"
    aria-describedby="manifold-video-caption"
  ></video>
  <figcaption id="manifold-video-caption">
    The product teaser: a site photo goes in, a trade and phase come out. The scores on screen are the model's confidence on
    one demo photo, not a measured accuracy. No sound.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .product-video {
    margin: var(--space-l) 0;
  }

  video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
</style>
